          "python",
          "Preset (PRE): Forces Q=1 immediately, regardless of clock\nClear (CLR):  Forces Q=0 immediately, regardless of clock\n\nThese are used for:\n- Power-on initialization\n- System reset\n- Emergency state recovery"
        ]
